  "//": "ONE-TAP PINBALL - the ball falls and bounces on its own. Every tap fires all three bumpers at once. Hit the targets in order and never let the ball drain.",
  "//mechanic": "Each bumper computes its own push on the ball and the ball sums the three, because a bumper cannot write to the ball's variables. Firing is global: one tap arms every bumper for a few frames, so the skill is timing, not aim.",
  "//order": "Targets must be taken 1 then 2 then 3: each target's hit term is gated on the previous target's flag, so an out-of-order touch does nothing.",
  "//drain": "There is no floor. Falling past the bottom edge costs a life and rebuilds the level.",
